{{SubpageNavBox|Evolution=yes|MergeTactics=yes}}{{Quote|Destroying enemy buildings with his massive cannon is his job; making a raggedy blond beard look good is his passion.}}

The Royal Giant is a {{Rarity|Common}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Royal Arena (Arena 7)]]. It spawns a slow, single-target, [[:Category:Building Cards|building]]-targeting, medium-ranged, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with high hitpoints and high damage. His appearance is similar to that of a [[Giant]], but he sports a dark navy coat with team-colored cuffs, has a mustache and bigger mutton chops, wears a crown and a chainmail, wields a [[Cannon]] with two gold ridges in the middle in one hand, and carries a cannonball in the other. A Royal Giant card costs 6 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

