===[[File:Royal Giant Common Modifier.png|45x45px]] Common: Splish Splash Splosh===
{{Quote|Splash damage}}
Royal Giant's bullet does an area of effect.

===[[File:Royal Giant Rare Modifier.png|45x45px]] Rare: Look Out, Over There!===
{{Quote|+200% range}}
