==History==
2016 
*The Royal Giant [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 29/2/2016, in the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]].
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Giant's damage by 20%.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12) and also changed his description. It used to say, ''“Sighting his massive cannon at enemy buildings, the Royal Giant comes in like a wrecking ball.''” The same update also fixed the “range bug” and decreased the Royal Giant's range but was compensated with a range increase. Overall, his range was increased to 6.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Giant's damage by 4%.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Giant's attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.5 seconds) and his first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
2017 
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Giant's deployment time to 2 seconds (from 1 second).
2018
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Giant's range to 5 tiles (from 6.5 tiles), increased his damage by 60%, and decreased his deployment time to 1 second (from 2 seconds).
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], removed the Royal Giant from [[Touchdown]] [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]].
2021
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Royal Giant's first attack time interval to 0.9 seconds (from 0.7 seconds).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 2/9/2022, a [[Version History|maintenance break]], changed the Royal Giant's card image and added a card render to the Royal Giant's card info screen.
2023 
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14), and added the Royal Giant's Evolution. It also added the Siege Weapon [[Card Mastery]] task for the Royal Giant.
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Giant's hitpoints by 3%.
2025

2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Royal Giant's hitpoints to 1.7 seconds (from 1.8 seconds).

